e new players, the evangelist begins to think something sinister is afoot. The holy man learns just how correct he is as the game’s new targets make their presence known.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3Kv6iR9ME7xt5STLeiNQNoa4MPq.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2400","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"384","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"384","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"11279","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"78916","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"73856","synopsis":"The team’s efforts to defeat the giant aliens are hindered by two thugs who are brutally tormenting a homeless man - the very same homeless man that Kei and Kato encountered just before their deaths.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gkrlD2Jx1gD0Uyb7DGU5k8KqMIV.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2400","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"384","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"384","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"11279","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"78916","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"73858","synopsis":"Kei goes on a rampage, leading the battle against the giant aliens. Yet another unhappy surprise awaits the team.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sO5F98B2zICojBEPwzZ7DH6Vyqt.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2400","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"384","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"384","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"11279","scope"