seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2400","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"384","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"384","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"11279","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"78916","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"73862","synopsis":"Kei returns to the Gantz and finds many familiar faces will be joining him in battle. Unfortunately, Kei is shocked to see that their alien prey wears a familiar face as well.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a6RQZTTn5wbtmYly1c7rX1L64u1.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2400","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"384","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"384","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"11279","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"78916","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"73863","synopsis":"With no explanation, the Gantz has chosen Kei to be hunted. At first, the rest of the players are unsure of what they should do - but the black sphere soon helps them decide that Kei should die.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rX3fLrgSpFp8OIrIuBhiXiXeYaA.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"2400","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"384","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"384","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"11279","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"78916","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"73864","synopsis":"The new players are beginning to see just how dangerous the two bum-killing freak